# TestNG discovers these listeners through the ServiceLoader mechanism.
#
# Why not @Listeners or the suite XML: an IAnnotationTransformer must be
# registered before TestNG reads the annotations, which @Listeners cannot do,
# and declaring listeners in every suite file duplicates the policy. Registering
# them here means a test launched from Eclipse with "Run as > TestNG Test"
# behaves exactly like the same test launched by Maven in the pipeline.
io.atlas.qa.core.listener.RetryTransformer
io.atlas.qa.core.listener.SuiteLifecycleListener
io.atlas.qa.core.listener.TestReportListener
